<doc id="175916" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175916" title="Czernina">
Czernina

Czernina [t͡ʂɛrˈɲina] (saka czarny "ireng"; kadang uga czarnina utawa czarna polewka - sup ireng) yaiku &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Polen"&gt;Polen sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Sar%C3%A9n"&gt;getih&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="B%C3%A8b%C3%A8k"&gt;bebek&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="duduh"&gt;duduh&lt;/a&gt; unggas sing jelas. Kadhangkala dikenal minangka "sup bebek", hen, kelinci utawa getih babi uga bisa digunakake. Ing basa Inggris bisa diarani " &lt;a href="Sop%20getih"&gt;sup getih&lt;/a&gt; bebek".
Umume rasa sup lan asem saka sup iku saka imbangan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging, ana atusan resep sing populer ing macem-macem wilayah ing &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt;. Antarane bahan sing digunakake yaiku sirup &lt;a href="plum"&gt;plum&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pir"&gt;pear&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pir"&gt;pir&lt;/a&gt; garing, plum utawa &lt;a href="C%C3%A9ri"&gt;ceri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cuka%20sari%20apel"&gt;cuka apel&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;. Kaya umume sup Polen, czernina biasane disajikake nganggo &lt;a href="kluski"&gt;kluski&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mi"&gt;mi&lt;/a&gt;e alus, &lt;a href="Markuni"&gt;makaroni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; rebus, utawa &lt;a href="pangsit"&gt;pangsit&lt;/a&gt;.
