<doc id="175921" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175921" title="Bicol cepet saji">
Bicol cepet saji

Bicol Express, sing diarani asli ing Bikol minangka sinilihan (), minangka panganan khas Filipina sing dipopulerake ing distrik Malate, Manila nanging digawe kanthi gaya Bicolano tradisional. Iki minangka &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebusan sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrica cabe dawa&lt;/a&gt; (siling haba ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;) utawa &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrica cabe cilik&lt;/a&gt; (siling labuyo ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="santen"&gt;santen&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;krim klapa&lt;/a&gt; (etahi gata ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;pasta udang&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;bagoong alamang&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;) utawa stockfish, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;. Piring kasebut diarani warga Laguna, Cely Kalaw, sajrone lomba masak ing taun 1970-an ing Malate, Manila. Jeneng sajian kasebut diilhami dening kereta api Bicol Express (Kereta Nasional Filipina) sing dioperasikake saka Tutuban, Manila nganti Legazpi, Albay (pusat regional wilayah Bicol). Jeneng sing misuwur kanggo panganan iki ing Wilayah Bicol ing &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; diidentifikasi minangka gulay na may lada, sing saiki dadi salah sawijining varian vegetarian sajian Bicol Express. Nalika suwe saya suwe, varian sajian Bicol Express ditambahi &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan laut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pescetarian"&gt;pescatarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;, lan versi liyane. Preparasi sajian kasebut beda-beda miturut daging sing ana ing sajian. Nilai nutrisi saka versi asli sajian Bicol Express ono gunane ing protein nanging ora sehat ing babagan lemak jenuh lan kolesterol sing akeh. Piring kasebut pindhah menyang &lt;a href="Pangan%20olahan"&gt;pamrosesan panganan&lt;/a&gt; lan produksi komersial supaya bisa didol kanthi gampang lan disimpen kanthi wektu sing luwih dawa.
<h2>Preparasi</h2>
Preparasi.
Bahan- &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;persiyapan&lt;/a&gt; utama nggawe sajian asli Bicol Express yaiku minyak, &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, potongan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;krim klapa / susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="siling%20haba"&gt;siling haba&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrica cabe dawa&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;bagoong alamang&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;pasta udang&lt;/a&gt;) lan sisi &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;. 
Langkah kapisan kanggo nggawe sajian iki yaiku pour minyak menyang wajan kanthi suhu panas. Kabeh &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt; kudu dicincang ukuran kubus 1-cm. Panganggone papak lan bawang ing masakan Filipina wis dipengaruhi dening wong-wong Spanyol sing &lt;a href="Ngos%C3%A8ng"&gt;ngicipi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; kasebut kanggo memperkaya rasa sajian. Bahan telu iki banjur dilebokake ing wajan lan dimasak suwene telung menit. Sabanjure, potongan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; ditambahake ing wajan lan masak nganti peteng dadi coklat. &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;Daging babi&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; utama sing nyedhiyakake dhasar sajian Bicol Express lan mbedakake karo variasi liyane. Sawise daging babi dadi coklat, &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;krim klapa / susu&lt;/a&gt; diwutahake menyang wajan lan direndhem nganti sawetara menit ing sangisore panas. Sabanjure, sawise 30 menit jenuh siling panas ing sangisore banyu asin, saluran &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; lan potong siling panas dadi irisan 1 inci banjur lebokake wajan. Siling haba digunakake tinimbang langit - langit labuyo amarga level SHU saka siling haba mung 50.000 SHU, sing bakal ngidini &lt;a href="Pedhes"&gt;spiciness&lt;/a&gt; luwih bisa diatur kanggo para pelanggan. Nanging, siling labuyo isih digunakake kanggo nggawe Bicol Express ing Semenanjung Bicol amarga warga pribumi luwih biasa karo &lt;a href="Pedhes"&gt;spiciness&lt;/a&gt;. Ing pungkasan &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bakal&lt;/a&gt; ditambahaké menyang telusur punika &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;bagoong alamang&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;urang tempel&lt;/a&gt;). Pendhudhuk Bicolano njupuk alamang (udang) kanthi alami liwat jaring cor banjur &lt;a href="Iwak%20fermentasi"&gt;fermentasi&lt;/a&gt; udang kanggo nggawe sadurunge &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;alam&lt;/a&gt;. Senadyan nggunakake tradisional &lt;a href="bagoong"&gt;bagoong&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;seasoning&lt;/a&gt; tujuan ing liyane masakan Filipino, anyar &lt;a href="Iwak%20fermentasi"&gt;fermented&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;bagoong alamang&lt;/a&gt; nambah roso saka Bicol Express dening kang "dasar sauce kanggo sajian". Piring Bicol Express disajikake panas karo sisih mangkok &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;sega&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;Beras&lt;/a&gt; penting ing panganan masakan Filipina lan sajian Bicol Express ora lengkap tanpa &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; penting iki. 
