<doc id="175935" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175935" title="Pierogi leniwé">
Pierogi leniwé

Pierogi leniwe, leniwe (secara harfiah "pangsit males") minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupapangsit sing digawe saka quark, &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, digodhog ing banyu asin sing entheng. Paling asring disajikake nganggo krim dobel / asem, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; utawa bespeckle &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;remah roti&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nggor%C3%A8ng"&gt;goreng&lt;/a&gt;, uga gula lan &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;. 
