<doc id="175945" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175945" title="Olahan Burma">
Olahan Burma

Masakan Burma minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan kang ditandhani karo macem-macem pasugatan, kayata kari Burma tradisional, &lt;a href="A%20thok%C3%A9"&gt;salad Burma&lt;/a&gt;, lan sup sing biasane dipangan karo nasi putih. Masakan Burma uga dilengkapi mie kanthi macem-macem jinis, kayata mi goreng utawa garing, sup mi, utawa salad mi uga roti India. Budaya &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; ing dalan uga duwe macem-macem macem-macem &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ngan%20Burma"&gt;fritter Burma&lt;/a&gt; tradisional lan cemilan tradisional sing diarani &lt;a href="mont"&gt;mont&lt;/a&gt;.
