<doc id="175950" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175950" title="Olahan Sudan Kidul">
Olahan Sudan Kidul

Masakan Sudan Kidul adhedhasar &lt;a href="Wiji-wijian"&gt;biji&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Canth%C3%A8l"&gt;sorghum&lt;/a&gt;). Iki nggunakake &lt;a href="Yam"&gt;ubi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, kacang-kacangan (kacang, &lt;a href="lentil"&gt;lentil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kacang%20brol"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Wedhus%20domestik"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wedhus%20domestik"&gt;kambing&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak ing&lt;/a&gt; sacedhake kali lan tlaga), &lt;a href="Bendi"&gt;okra&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; uga. Daging digodhog, dipanggang utawa di pepe. Masakan Sudan Kidul dipengaruhi karo &lt;a href="Olahan%20Arab"&gt;masakan Arab&lt;/a&gt;
