<doc id="175980" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175980" title="Kari Burma">
Kari Burma

Kari Burma nuduhake macem-macem sajian ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Burma"&gt;masakan Burma&lt;/a&gt; sing kalebu protein utawa sayuran sing direndhem utawa direndhem ing pangkal kari arum. Kari Burma umume beda karo &lt;a href="kari"&gt;kari&lt;/a&gt; Asia Tenggara liyane (contone, &lt;a href="Thai%20kari"&gt;kari Thailand&lt;/a&gt;) amarga kari Burma nggunakake &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; garing saliyane jamu seger lan aromatik, lan asring luwih entheng. Kari Burma gampang kasedhiya ing omah kari ing saindenging negara. Biasane, diiringi nasi lan macem-macem lawuh, sup, lan &lt;a href="A%20thok%C3%A9"&gt;salad Burma sing&lt;/a&gt; diarani athoke. Kari Burma uga bisa ditambah karo roti &lt;a href="Naan"&gt;lapis&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="Naan"&gt;nanbya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;palata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puri"&gt;aloo puri&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Dosa"&gt;toshay&lt;/a&gt;.
Repertoire kari Burma durung dikodifikasi. Variasi umum kari Burma kapacak ing ngisor iki.
