<doc id="175984" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175984" title="Nan-e-kabab">
Nan-e-kabab

Nan-e kabab (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Persia&lt;/a&gt;: نان كباب) (roti karo kabab) minangka &lt;a href="Olahan%20nasional"&gt;panganan nasional ing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt;. Pangananane sederhana, kalebu &lt;a href="Kebab"&gt;kabab&lt;/a&gt;, sing ana macem-macem jinis Persia, lan jinis roti datar Persia (khususe &lt;a href="Lavash"&gt;nan-e lavash&lt;/a&gt;). Layane dilayani ing endi wae ing saindenging Iran saiki, nanging biasane digandhengake karo bagean kidul lan tengah negara, lan bisa uga asale saka provinsi Fars.
Biasane, panganan iki diwatesi mung kanggo &lt;a href="kabab%20koobideh"&gt;kabab koobideh&lt;/a&gt; (macem-macem nan-e kabab umume), uga &lt;a href="Jujeh%20kabab"&gt;kabab jujeh, kabab&lt;/a&gt; shish, shishleek, lan chenjeh. Kabab barg ora nate digunakake, lan ana gandhengane karo &lt;a href="chelow%20kabab"&gt;chelow kabab&lt;/a&gt;.

