<doc id="175985" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175985" title="Aush reshteh">
Aush reshteh

Reshteh Aush utawa ush-e-reshteh (&lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;: آش رشته‎‎) yaiku jinis aush (sup kenthel Iran) sing nampilake &lt;a href="K%C3%A8sm%C3%A9"&gt;reshteh&lt;/a&gt; (mie lancip) lan &lt;a href="kashk"&gt;kashk&lt;/a&gt; (produk susu, digawe saka yogurt masak utawa garing), umume digawe ing &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Azerbaijan"&gt;Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;.
Bahan-bahan sing digunakake yaiku reshteh (mie lancip), kashk (kaya susu, produk susu fermentasi), &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;ramuan&lt;/a&gt; kayata &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="dill"&gt;dill&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;endhas bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt; lan kadang &lt;a href="ketumbar"&gt;ketumbar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;kacang polong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kacang%20mripat%20ireng"&gt;kacang mripat ireng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="lentil"&gt;lentil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Godhong%20Mint"&gt;mint&lt;/a&gt; garing, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;minyak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka sup sing &lt;a href="vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt; nanging bisa digawe &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt; kanthi ngilangi kashk; Utawa, daging bisa ditambahake.
