Burrata

Burrata (]) yaiku keju susu sapi Italia (sok-sok &lt;a href="Kebo"&gt;susu kebo&lt;/a&gt;) digawe saka &lt;a href="mozzarella"&gt;mozzarella&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt;. Selubung njaba yaiku keju sing padhet, nanging ing &lt;a href="Stracciatella%20di%20bufala"&gt;njerone&lt;/a&gt; ngemot &lt;a href="Stracciatella%20di%20bufala"&gt;stracciatella&lt;/a&gt; lan krim, menehi &lt;a href="Tekstur%20panganan"&gt;tekstur&lt;/a&gt; alus lan alus. Iki khas &lt;a href="Puglia"&gt;Apulia&lt;/a&gt;.
Burrata diwiwiti kaya mozzarella lan keju liyane, kanthi rennet digunakake kanggo nyusut susu sing anget. Boten kados keju liyane, Nanging, ing mozzarella seger &lt;a href="Curd"&gt;curds&lt;/a&gt; sing nggebyur panas &lt;a href="whey"&gt;whey&lt;/a&gt; utawa entheng salted banyu, kneaded, lan ditarik kanggo berkembang strings menowo melar (pasta filata), banjur shaped.
