<doc id="176120" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176120" title="Pai béri saskatoon">
Pai béri saskatoon

Pie berry saskatoon minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa
&lt;a href="Pai"&gt;pie&lt;/a&gt; kanthi isi berry saskatoon. Pai kasebut asale ing &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; lan asring disajik es krim vanilla minangka panganan cuci mulut. Bahan-bahan utama pai berry saskatoon kalebu woh wohan beri saskatoon, kerak pie, gula, tepung jagung utawa tepung, butter lan semangat / jus lemon. Pai kasebut kadhang digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Blub%C3%A9ri"&gt;blueberry&lt;/a&gt; minangka pengganti woh wohan beri saskatoon. 
