Liquorice asin

Salty liquorice, salmiak liquorice utawa salmiac liquorice, macem-macem &lt;a href="liquorice"&gt;liquorice&lt;/a&gt; roso karo &lt;a href="Tetanduran%20jamu%20lan%20bumbu"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; "salmiak uyah" (sat ammoniac ; &lt;a href="amonium%20klorida"&gt;amonium klorida&lt;/a&gt;), lan punika umum &lt;a href="Panganan%20legi"&gt;confection&lt;/a&gt; ditemokaké ing &lt;a href="Nagara-nagara%20Nordika"&gt;negara Nordic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Benelux"&gt;Benelux&lt;/a&gt;, lan lor Jerman. Uyah salmiak menehi minuman keras uyah lan rasa asin (mula jenenge); mirip karo tanin - ciri khas &lt;a href="anggur%20abang"&gt;anggur abang&lt;/a&gt;, sing nambah rasa pait lan rasa ing rasa. Ngombe omben-omben salmiak bisa ngrangsang langit-langit lan nanggepi sing gurih utawa ora gurih. Minyak &lt;a href="Adas%20legi"&gt;anise&lt;/a&gt; uga bisa dadi bahan utama tambahan kanggo minuman keras asin. Omben-omben asin tambahan ditambah karo uyah salmiak utawa bubuk salmiak, utawa kadang &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;uyah meja&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyane digunakake ing permen, salmiak uga digunakake kanggo ngicipi &lt;a href="vodka"&gt;vodka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Soklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Br%C3%A9ndi"&gt;brendi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rye"&gt;rye&lt;/a&gt; sulingan, es krim, omben-omben cola, &lt;a href="snus"&gt;snus&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;.
