Kulolo (&lt;a href="Basa%20Hawai%27i"&gt;Hawaiian&lt;/a&gt;: kūlolo; mbandhingaké lololo "sedhep, sugih") iku &lt;a href="Olahan%20Hawaii"&gt;Hawaiian&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;dessert&lt;/a&gt; digawe utamané karo baking utawa steamed grated Taro corms lan salah siji karo grated &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; daging utawa &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;susu klapa&lt;/a&gt;. Dianggep minangka &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt;, kulolo duwe konsistensi sing padhet kaya fudge lan asring disajik dadi kothak. Konsistensi kasebut uga diterangake minangka kenyal lan lumpy kaya &lt;a href="tapioka"&gt;tapioka&lt;/a&gt;, lan rasane padha karo &lt;a href="Karam%C3%A8l"&gt;karamel&lt;/a&gt;. 
Resep kulolo tradisional mbutuhake bungkus campuran godhong &lt;a href="Ti%20%28tanduran%29"&gt;ti&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Imu"&gt;panggang&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="imu"&gt;imu&lt;/a&gt; (oven lemah) suwene 6 nganti 8 jam. Resep modern kudu nyelehake campuran ing wajan, ditutup nganggo foil aluminium, lan panggang ing oven standar udakara 1-2 jam. 
