<doc id="176302" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176302" title="Fluffernutter">
Fluffernutter

Fluffernutter (uga diarani "butter peanut and marshmallow sandwich", "peanut butter and marshmallow fluff sandwich", utawa "peanut butter and marshmallow sandwich") yaiku &lt;a href="Sandwich"&gt;sandwich sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo &lt;a href="Sel%C3%A9%20kacang"&gt;butter kacang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Krim%20marshmallow"&gt;crem marshmallow&lt;/a&gt; biasane disajikake ing &lt;a href="roti%20putih"&gt;roti putih&lt;/a&gt;. Variasi sandwich kalebu substitusi roti gandum lan tambahan macem-macem bahan sing legi, asin, lan &lt;a href="gurih"&gt;gurih&lt;/a&gt;. Istilah fluffernutter uga bisa digunakake kanggo nggambarake panganan liyane, utamane panganan cuci mulut, sing kalebu butter kacang lan crem marshmallow.
Sandwich pisanan digawe ing wiwitan abad kaping 20 sawise &lt;a href="Krim%20marshmallow"&gt;creme marshmallow&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ol%C3%A8san"&gt;panyebaran&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="Marshmallow"&gt;marshmallow sing&lt;/a&gt; manis, ditemokake ing &lt;a href="Massachusetts"&gt;Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt;. Sajrone Perang Dunia I, resep kanggo butter kacang lan sandwich creme marshmallow, conto paling awal saka sandwich, diterbitake. Tembung "fluffernutter" digawe dening agensi pariwara ing taun 1960 minangka cara sing luwih efektif kanggo pasar sandwich.
