Saos salad

Ranch dressing minangka &lt;a href="Salad"&gt;dressing salad&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika sing&lt;/a&gt; biasane digawe saka &lt;a href="Susu%20mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;buttermilk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;herbs&lt;/a&gt; (umume &lt;a href="Lokio"&gt;chives&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;parsley&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="dill"&gt;dill&lt;/a&gt;), lan rempah-rempah (umume &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt; lan wiji sawi lemah) dicampur dadi saos adhedhasar &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayones&lt;/a&gt; utawa emulsi minyak liyane. &lt;a href="Krim%20asem"&gt;Krim&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt; lan yogurt asring digunakake saliyane, utawa minangka sulih buttermilk lan mayonnaise.
Peternakan minangka &lt;a href="Salad"&gt;dressing salad sing paling larang&lt;/a&gt; ing Amerika Serikat wiwit taun 1992, nalika nyerang &lt;a href="Klamben%20Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga misuwur ing Amerika Serikat minangka &lt;a href="Saos%20celupan"&gt;mencelupake&lt;/a&gt;, lan minangka rasa kanggo &lt;a href="Kripik%20kenthang"&gt;keripik kentang&lt;/a&gt; lan panganan liyane. Ing 2017, 40% wong Amerika ngarani peternakan minangka klambi favorit, miturut panaliten dening Association for Dressings and Sauces. 
