Muhallebi

Muhallebi (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: مهلبية‎‎, Mahalabia) yaiku &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; susu sing asale legendaris wiwit Sassanid Persia (224-651). Bahan baku yaiku beras, gula, tepung beras lan susu. Panganan cuci mulut misuwur ing &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Suriah"&gt;Suriah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Libanon"&gt;Libanon&lt;/a&gt;, Israel lan negara-negara Timur Tengah liyane. Ing &lt;a href="Abad%20Tengahan"&gt;Abad Pertengahan&lt;/a&gt;, muhallebi &lt;a href="Blancmange"&gt;lan blancmange&lt;/a&gt; mitra Eropa digawe karo pitik abon. Resep tradisional isih umum ing &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;.
