Saganaki

Ing masakan Yunani, saganaki (&lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; σαγανάκι) minangka salah sawijining macem-macem panganan sing disiapake ing wajan cilik, sing paling misuwur yaiku panganan sing &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;digodhog kanggo keju goreng&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Katrangan</h2>
Katrangan.
Keju sing digunakake ing keju saganaki biasane graviera, kefalograviera, &lt;a href="halloumi"&gt;halloumi&lt;/a&gt;, kasseri, kefalotyri, utawa keju &lt;a href="F%C3%A9ta"&gt;feta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Susu%20domba"&gt;susu wedhus.&lt;/a&gt; Variasi regional kalebu panggunaan keju formaela ing Arachova, &lt;a href="halloumi"&gt;halloumi&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Siprus"&gt;Siprus&lt;/a&gt;, lan vlahotiri ing Metsovo. Keju kasebut lebur ing wajan cilik nganti umpluk lan umume disajekake nganggo &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt; lan mrico. Dipangan karo &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;. Piring liyane sing dimasak ing wajan saganaki kalebu saganaki udang (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: γαρίδες σαγανάκι, garídes saganáki), lan kerang saganaki (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: μύδια σαγανάκι, mýdia saganáki), sing biasane &lt;a href="F%C3%A9ta"&gt;adhedhasar dhasar feta&lt;/a&gt; lan kalebu saus &lt;a href="Tomat"&gt;tomat pedhes&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="Tomat"&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;
