Cachupa

Cachupa (Portuguese pronunciation: [kɐˈʃupɐ], Cape Verdean Creole Katxupa [kɐˈʧupɐ]) minangka panganan misuwur saka &lt;a href="Pongol%20Verd%C3%A9"&gt;kapuloan Cape Verde&lt;/a&gt;, Afrika Kulon. Iki minangka rebusan jagung (&lt;a href="hominy"&gt;hominy&lt;/a&gt;) sing wis dimasak alon-alon, kacang buncis, singkong, ubi, &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20wedhus"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;), lan asring morcela (&lt;a href="sosis%20getih"&gt;sosis getih&lt;/a&gt;). Disebut minangka &lt;a href="Olahan%20nasional"&gt;sajian nasional&lt;/a&gt; negara kasebut, saben pulau duwe variasi daerah dhewe-dhewe. Versi resep sing diarani cachupa rica cenderung duwe bahan-bahan liyane tinimbang pobre cachupa sing luwih gampang.
Sisa cachupa asring digoreng maneh, panganan sing asile diarani cachupa frita, cachupa guisada utawa cachupa refogada, tegese " cachupa goreng". Piring iki bisa disedhiyakake kanggo &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt; nganggo endhog goreng lan sosis lokal goreng (linguiça) utawa mackerel goreng. 
