Brazo de Mercedes

Brazo de Mercedes minangka &lt;a href="Bolu%20Gulung"&gt;gulung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="meringue"&gt;meringue&lt;/a&gt; tradisional Filipina kanthi isi &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;kastard sing&lt;/a&gt; biasane dibuwang karo &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Pionono"&gt;Yaiku&lt;/a&gt; jinis piano. 
Ora kaya jinis &lt;a href="Pionono"&gt;piano&lt;/a&gt; Filipina liyane sing digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20chiffon"&gt;chiffon&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20spons"&gt;kue spons&lt;/a&gt;, brazo de Mercedes digawe saka &lt;a href="meringue"&gt;meringue&lt;/a&gt; lan mula ora nggunakake &lt;a href="Glepung"&gt;tepung&lt;/a&gt;. Meringue digawe saka &lt;a href="Putih%20endhog"&gt;endhog putih&lt;/a&gt;, krim tartar, lan gula pasir. Isi iki biasane kanggo &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;panganan sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Kuning%20endhog"&gt;kuning telur&lt;/a&gt;, gula, lan susu sing dimasak ing geni cilik ing ketel kaping pindho. Úa kaya &lt;a href="Jeruk%20siyem"&gt;calamansi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kulit%20jeruk"&gt;zest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Vanilla%20%C3%A8kstrak"&gt;extract vanilla&lt;/a&gt; bisa uga ditambahake menyang custard ing. Sawise meringue dipanggang, custard nyebar kanthi rata ing sak permukaan banjur digulung dadi silinder. Biasane digawe adhem lan dibumboni &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt; sadurunge disuguhake. 
Versi panganan cuci mulut modern bisa duwe macem-macem bahan lan bahan. Variasi kasebut biasane duwe jeneng sing beda, kayata brazo de &lt;a href="Uwi"&gt;ube&lt;/a&gt;, brazo de &lt;a href="Pandhan%20wangi"&gt;pandan&lt;/a&gt;, brazo de &lt;a href="Buko%20Salad"&gt;buko pandan&lt;/a&gt;, brazo de &lt;a href="tsokolate"&gt;tsokolate&lt;/a&gt;, brazo de &lt;a href="Mangga%20Carabao"&gt;mangga&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. 
