Morgado ora nate ngeculake resep saos huli-huli, sanajan koki liyane wis nggawe perkiraan. 
Umume resep mbutuhake glas utawa saos kanthi bahan kalebu &lt;a href="jus%20nanas"&gt;jus nanas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="saos%20tomat"&gt;saos tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap"&gt;kecap&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Gula%20soklat"&gt;gula coklat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20wij%C3%A9n"&gt;minyak wijen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara resep bisa uga njaluk &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20inggris"&gt;saus Worcestershire&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sriracha"&gt;Sriracha&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="serpihan%20mrica%20abang"&gt;serpihan mrica abang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cuka%20anggur%20beras"&gt;anggur beras&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Cuka%20Sherry"&gt;cuka sherry&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Duduh"&gt;duduh pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="anggur%20putih"&gt;anggur putih&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara resep-resep nelpon kanggo &lt;a href="Ngasinak%C3%A9"&gt;Kingo&lt;/a&gt; pitik ing solusi karo &lt;a href="uyah%20kosher"&gt;uyah kosher&lt;/a&gt;, gula, &lt;a href="Godhong%20teluk"&gt;teluk godhong&lt;/a&gt;, papak, &lt;a href="Lenga%20wij%C3%A9n"&gt;minyak wijen&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Paduka"&gt;thyme&lt;/a&gt;, sadurunge marinating ing sauce.
