<doc id="176489" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176489" title="Curau">
Curau

Curau (Portuguese pronunciation: [kuɾaw]) iku salah sawijining jinis olahan saka &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; manis &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;dessert&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka jus dipencet saka &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;, masak karo &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;.
Tembung curau biasane digunakake ing negara-negara kidul kayata &lt;a href="S%C3%A3o%20Paulo"&gt;São Paulo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mato%20Grosso"&gt;Mato Grosso&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mato%20Grosso%20do%20Sul"&gt;Mato Grosso do Sul&lt;/a&gt;. Uga diarani corá (pronounced [koˈɾa]) ing &lt;a href="Minas%20Gerais"&gt;Minas Gerais&lt;/a&gt;, papa-de-milho [ˈPapɐdʒiˈmiʎu] "bubur jagung" ing &lt;a href="Rio%20de%20Janeiro"&gt;Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt;, lan canjica [kɐ̃ˈʒikɐ] ing sisih lor Brasil (wilayah Timur Laut lan Lor).

