Shwé yin ayé

Shwe yin aye (&lt;a href="basa%20Burma"&gt;Burma&lt;/a&gt;: ရွှေရင်အေး ;] &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;) minangka panganan&lt;/a&gt; cuci mulut tradisional Burma sing umume digandhengake karo musim Thingyan. 
&lt;a href="Kyaukkyaw"&gt;Panganan cuci&lt;/a&gt; mulut disajikake adhem, lan kalebu &lt;a href="Beras%20ketan"&gt;nasi ketan&lt;/a&gt; manis, mutiara &lt;a href="sagu"&gt;sagu&lt;/a&gt;, mie jeli &lt;a href="Pandhan%20wangi"&gt;pandan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="C%C3%A8ndhol"&gt;(cendol&lt;/a&gt;), lan kiub kyaukkyaw, jeli klapa, lan irisan &lt;a href="Roti%20putih"&gt;roti putih sing&lt;/a&gt; dibungkus ing ramuan &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;santen sing&lt;/a&gt; legi.
