<doc id="176499" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176499" title="Kibbeling">
Kibbeling

Kibbeling punika salah sawijining jinis olahan saka &lt;a href="Masakan%20Walanda"&gt;Dutch&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;cemilan&lt;/a&gt; dumadi saka &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;batter&lt;/a&gt; iwak, umum dadi karo &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayonnaise&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saos%20bawang"&gt;saus bawang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20tartar"&gt;sauce tartar&lt;/a&gt;. Ing abad kesembilan belas, iki nuduhake sampah uyah (pipi) iwak kod, sing dadi bagean penting saka panganan populer. Iki minangka panganan sing populer ing Walanda. 
