<doc id="176532" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176532" title="Olahan Afghanistan">
Olahan Afghanistan

Masakan Afghanistan (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Dari"&gt;Persia&lt;/a&gt;: آشپزی افغانستان, Pashto: د افغانستان خواړه) minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan umume didhasarake ing panen utama negara, kayata &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawawut"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;pari&lt;/a&gt;. Kasedhiya staples kasebut yaiku woh-wohan lan sayuran asli lan produk susu kayata &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;yogurt&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="whey"&gt;whey&lt;/a&gt;. Keahlian kuliner bangsa kasebut nggambarake keragaman etnis lan geografis. Afghanistan dikenal kanggo kualitas sawijining delima, &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt; shaped, lan manis, rugby-bal-balan melons. &lt;a href="Olahan%20nasional"&gt;Masakan nasional&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Afghanistan"&gt;Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt; yaiku kabuli palaw. 
