<doc id="176599" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176599" title="Casunziei">
Casunziei

Casunziei minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan..Cangkang kothak, biasane udakara 3,5 nganti 3.5 cm, kasusun saka rong lembar pasta sing ditekan ing tapel wates, kayata ravioli.
Pengisian sing wis mateng lan sing digiling kanthi apik beda-beda saben dhaerah lan biasane kalebu &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ricotta"&gt;keju ricotta&lt;/a&gt;. Resep-resep asli saka &lt;a href="Cortina%20d%27Ampezzo"&gt;Cortina d'Ampezzo&lt;/a&gt; sing "abang" macem-macem (casunziei rosc) karo &lt;a href="beet"&gt;beet&lt;/a&gt;, kentang, lan Veronese abang turnips ; lan "ijo" (casunziei verdes) kanthi &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayem&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Lokio"&gt;erba cipollina sing tuwuh&lt;/a&gt; ing ngiseni. Varietas liyane duwe isi &lt;a href="waluh"&gt;waluh&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Lobak"&gt;radishes&lt;/a&gt;. Isi bisa uga kalebu bahan liyane kayata &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, jinis &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wiji%20poppy"&gt;wiji popia&lt;/a&gt;, lsp. Utamane, casunziei all'ampezzana duwe Isi saka abang lan kuning turnips lan biasane dadi karo ilang &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, Poppy wiji, lan &lt;a href="Parmigiano-Reggiano"&gt;keju Parmesan&lt;/a&gt;. Servings liyane SAGE -flavored butter ilang, utawa saus basis radish. 
