<doc id="176647" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176647" title="Olahan Pakistan">
Olahan Pakistan

Masakan Pakistani (&lt;a href="Basa%20Urdu"&gt;Basa Urdu&lt;/a&gt;: #ALIH) bisa ditondoi kanthi campuran macem-macem tradhisi masak regional saka &lt;a href="Anak%20bawana%20India"&gt;benua India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asia%20Tengah"&gt;Asia Tengah&lt;/a&gt; uga unsur-unsur &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Mughal"&gt;warisane Mughal&lt;/a&gt;. Ing macem-macem masakan sing asalé saka &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; 's &lt;a href="Klompok%20etnis%20ing%20Pakistan"&gt;suku&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Budaya%20Pakistan"&gt;budaya&lt;/a&gt; bhinéka.
Sarapan khas Pakistan, sing diarani lokal nashtā (ناشتہ‎), kalebu &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; (rebus / scrambled / goreng / omelet), irisan roti utawa &lt;a href="Roti%20India"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;parathas&lt;/a&gt;, sheermal karo &lt;a href="T%C3%A8h"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="lassi"&gt;lassi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kulcha"&gt;kulcha&lt;/a&gt; kanthi chole, &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;qeema&lt;/a&gt; (daging cincang), woh-wohan mangsan (&lt;a href="Pelem"&gt;mangga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt;, melon, &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane), &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;mentega&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;selai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="shami%20kebab"&gt;shami kebab&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kacang%20woh"&gt;kacang-kacangan&lt;/a&gt;. Kadang sarapan kalebu barang panggang kaya &lt;a href="bakarkhani"&gt;bakarkhani&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rusk"&gt;rusks&lt;/a&gt;. Sajrone preinan lan akhir minggu, halwa poori lan &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; -kacangan sok dipangan. Ing Punjab, sarson ka saag (godhong mustar) lan &lt;a href="Makki%20di%20roti"&gt;maakai ki roti&lt;/a&gt; (roti jagung) minangka favorit lokal. Masyarakat Punjabi uga seneng khatchauri, jajanan gurih sing diisi keju. Pakistan ora beda karo negara-negara Asia liyane, ing pangertene panganan daging dipangan minangka sarapan, utamane nalika preinan. Sarapan Minggu tradisional bisa uga &lt;a href="Paya%20%28panganan%29"&gt;Siri-Payay&lt;/a&gt; (endhas lan sikil wedhus utawa sapi) utawa &lt;a href="Nihari"&gt;Nihari&lt;/a&gt; (نہاری‎) (sajian sing dimasak sewengi supaya daginge empuk banget. Jeneng "Nihari" asale saka tembung Arab "Nihar", tegese "Day" utawa "Day break".) Akeh wong sing biasane nggunakake "Bong" (kari Shank) nalika dina Minggu awan.
