<doc id="176658" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176658" title="Babi masak pindho">
Babi masak pindho

Daging babi mateng kaping pindho utawa daging babi mateng (Chinese) iku salah sawijining sajian Cina saka Sichuan. Bahan-bahan sajian kasebut kalebu &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, sing wis direndhem, diiris, lan digoreng; umume sayuran sing digoreng kayata kubis, mrico, bawang, utawa daun bawang; lan saus sing bisa uga kalebu anggur beras Shaoxing, &lt;a href="Saos%20hoisin"&gt;saus hoisin&lt;/a&gt;, kecap, gula, jahe, tempel kacang cabai, lan &lt;a href="Saos%20tianmian"&gt;pasta kacang tianmianjiang&lt;/a&gt;.Panganan iki umume digandhengake karo yan jian rou (Chinese), sing rasane padha karo daging babi sing wis mateng kaping pindho, nanging kanthi proses masak sing beda.
<h2>Preparasi</h2>
Preparasi.
Proses masak daging babi sing mateng kaping pindho yaiku ngemot &lt;a href="Weteng%20babi"&gt;steak daging babi sing dhisik&lt;/a&gt; ing banyu kanthi rempah-rempah, kayata jahe, cengkeh, anise bintang, jujubes, utawa uyah. Sawise digawe adhem kanggo ngencengi daging, banjur diiris irisan lancip. Daging babi banjur bali menyang wok lan cethek goreng minyak, biasane ditambah karo sawetara sayuran. Sayuran sing paling umum digunakake yaiku godhong bawang putih, &lt;a href="Sawi%20putih"&gt;kubis napa&lt;/a&gt;, lada lada, lan &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;daun bawang&lt;/a&gt;.
