Khow suey

Khow suey (saka basa &lt;a href="basa%20Burma"&gt;Burma&lt;/a&gt;: ခေါက်ဆွဲ), yaiku &lt;a href="Sop%20mi"&gt;sup mi sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Mi"&gt;mie endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kari"&gt;daging sapi kari&lt;/a&gt; utawa pitik karo &lt;a href="santen"&gt;santen&lt;/a&gt;, disuguhake kanthi macem-macem &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu sing&lt;/a&gt; kontras. Cetha jeruk nipis uga nambah rasa cemas ing khow suey. Panganan kasebut padha karo sajian mie Burma sing &lt;a href="Ohn%20no%20khao%20sw%C3%A8"&gt;ora ana khauk swe&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi harfiah 'mie santen'.
Piring kasebut, dikenal kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="ohn%20no%20khao%20sw%C3%A8"&gt;ohn no khao swè&lt;/a&gt;, asale saka &lt;a href="Myanmar"&gt;Burma&lt;/a&gt;, lan teka ing &lt;a href="India%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;India Wétan&lt;/a&gt; karo India sing migrasi saka Burma nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Dunia II&lt;/a&gt;. Digandhengake karo &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan jalanan&lt;/a&gt; ing India. Komunitas &lt;a href="Wong%20memon"&gt;Memon ing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; uga adaptasi sajian iki, bisa uga cocog karo emigrasi wong Asia Kidul saka Burma ing taun 1960-an, lan saiki dadi panganan Memon perwakilan sing saiki dikenal minangka khausa. 
