Groat

Groats (utawa ing sawetara kasus, "woh wohan beri") sing &lt;a href="Klobot"&gt;hulled&lt;/a&gt; kernels saka macem-macem &lt;a href="S%C3%A9r%C3%A9alia"&gt;sereal&lt;/a&gt; pari-parian, kayata &lt;a href="Haver"&gt;oat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gandum%20ireng"&gt;Rye&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Jawawut"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt;. Groats sing kabèh pari-parian sing kalebu ing kuman sereal lan-sugih serat bran bagean saka gandum, sarta &lt;a href="Endosperma"&gt;endosperm&lt;/a&gt; (kang produk biasanipun saka panggilingan).Groat uga bisa diprodhuksi saka wiji pseudocereal kayata soba.
