<doc id="176691" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176691" title="Olahan Uruguay">
Olahan Uruguay

Masakan Uruguay minangka gabungan saka sawetara negara Eropa, utamane saka panganan Mediterania saka &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Portegal"&gt;Portugal&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;. Pengaruh liyane ing masakan asale saka &lt;a href="imigrasi"&gt;imigrasi&lt;/a&gt; saka negara kayata &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sekotlan"&gt;Skotlandia&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Gastronomi"&gt;Gastronomi&lt;/a&gt; Uruguay minangka asil saka imigrasi, tinimbang &lt;a href="Wong%20Indian"&gt;masakan Amerindian&lt;/a&gt; lokal, amarga koloni anyar kasebut ora ngandel karo masarakat Charrúa asli.  Pengaruh Spanyol akeh banget: &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Churro"&gt;cuci&lt;/a&gt; mulut kaya churros (silinder &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;kue&lt;/a&gt;, biasane digoreng, kadang diisi dulce de leche), &lt;a href="Cr%C3%A8me%20karam%C3%A8l"&gt;flan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ensa%C3%AFmada"&gt;ensaimadas&lt;/a&gt; yoo (roti manis Catalan), lan alfajores kabeh digawa saka Spanyol. Uga ana macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebus sing&lt;/a&gt; dikenal minangka guisos utawa estofado, arroce (piring beras kayata &lt;a href="paella"&gt;paella&lt;/a&gt;), lan fabada (rebus kacang &lt;a href="Asturias"&gt;Asturian).&lt;/a&gt; Kabeh guo lan pucheros tradisional &lt;a href="Puchero"&gt;(godhang&lt;/a&gt;) uga asale saka Spanyol. Persiapan iwak Uruguay, kayata iwak &lt;a href="Cod%20gerih"&gt;uyah garing&lt;/a&gt; (bacalao), &lt;a href="Cumi-cumi%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;cumi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="gurita"&gt;gurita&lt;/a&gt;, asale saka wilayah &lt;a href="Pa%C3%ADs%20Vasco"&gt;Basque&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Galicia%20%28Spanyol%29"&gt;Galicia&lt;/a&gt;, lan uga Portugal. Amarga tradhisi Italia sing kuat, kabeh &lt;a href="Pasta"&gt;panganan pasta&lt;/a&gt; Italia sing misuwur ana ing Uruguay kalebu &lt;a href="ravioli"&gt;ravioli&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lasagna"&gt;lasagne&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tortellini"&gt;tortellini&lt;/a&gt;, fettuccine, lan &lt;a href="gnocchi"&gt;gnocchi&lt;/a&gt; tradisional. Sanajan pasta bisa disajikake kanthi saos, ana siji saus khusus sing digawe dening wong Uruguay. Saus caruso yaiku saus pasta sing digawe saka &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim dobel&lt;/a&gt;, daging, bawang, ham lan &lt;a href="Jamur%20pangan"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;. Iki misuwur banget karo sorrentinos lan &lt;a href="agnolotti"&gt;agnolotti&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku, ana pengaruh basa Jerman ing masakan Uruguay, utamane ing masakan sing legi. Kue-kue sing dikenal kanthi jeneng bizcochos asale saka basa Jermanik: &lt;a href="croissant"&gt;croissant&lt;/a&gt;, sing diarani medialunas, sing paling populer, lan bisa ditemokake ing rong jinis: adhedhasar butter-lan lard. Asale uga basa Jerman yaiku basa Bali sing dikenal kanthi sebutan bolas de fraile ("bal friar"), lan gulung diarani &lt;a href="Pionono"&gt;piononos&lt;/a&gt; Facturas dibaptis maneh karo jeneng lokal amarga diwenehi fonologi Jerman sing angel, lan biasane Uruguay kanthi ditambah dulce de leche. Malah piring kaya chucrut (&lt;a href="Sau%C3%A9rkraut"&gt;sauerkraut&lt;/a&gt;) uga wis digawe masakan utama Uruguay.
Popular &lt;a href="Perm%C3%A8n"&gt;gulali&lt;/a&gt; sing membrillo &lt;a href="quince"&gt;quince&lt;/a&gt; senggol lan &lt;a href="Dulce%20de%20leche"&gt;Dulce de Leche&lt;/a&gt;, kang digawe saka susu carmelized. Pasta manis, &lt;a href="dulce%20de%20leche"&gt;dulce de leche&lt;/a&gt;, digunakake kanggo ngisi cookie, kue, pancake, &lt;a href="Mille-feuille"&gt;milhojas&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Alfajor"&gt;alfajores&lt;/a&gt;. Alfajores yaiku cookie roti &lt;a href="Roti%20cekak"&gt;cekak sing dicampur&lt;/a&gt; karo dulce de leche utawa tempel buah. Dulce de leche digunakake uga ing flan con dulce de leche.
