Cocido lebaniego

Cocido lebaniego minangka panganan tradisional saka wilayah Liébana ing Cantabria, &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;Rebus iki&lt;/a&gt; duwe sawetara bahan penting, kalebu &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; -kacangan saka kotamadya Potes, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; lan sayur-sayuran collard (saiki &lt;a href="Kul"&gt;kubis&lt;/a&gt; kadang diganti karo sayur-sayuran collard). Bahan-bahan liyane saka resep iki dikenal minangka compangu, sing nuduhake daging saka daging babi, kayata &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="tocino"&gt;tocino&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Pudhing%20ireng"&gt;puding ireng&lt;/a&gt; (morcilla), &lt;a href="chorizo"&gt;chorizo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan tambahan liyane yaiku &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, utamane &lt;a href="cecina"&gt;cecina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="balung"&gt;balung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pangisian"&gt;isian&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Glepung"&gt;tepung roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="chorizo"&gt;chorizo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt;.
Sajian iki sugih banget lan regane nutrisi. Mula, dipangan minangka &lt;a href="panganan%20utama"&gt;panganan utama&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;Sayur sup&lt;/a&gt; dirasakake luwih dhisik, banjur &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;cah&lt;/a&gt; -cah (sok-sok nganggo &lt;a href="Selada"&gt;apu&lt;/a&gt;) lan pungkasane &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Pangisian"&gt;isine&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan kadang-kadang &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; disajikake bebarengan.
