<doc id="176763" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=176763" title="Lox">
Lox

Lox (Yiddish) Iki salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa fillet saka &lt;a href="Ngasinak%C3%A9"&gt;brined&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Iwak%20Salmon"&gt;salmon&lt;/a&gt;. Lox asring disajikake ing &lt;a href="bagel"&gt;bagel&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20krim"&gt;krim keju&lt;/a&gt;, lan asring dihias nganggo &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Timun"&gt;irisan, timun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="caper"&gt;caper&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Referensi</h2>

