Aushak

Aushak, uga ditulis ashak [Pashto / Persia: اشک], iku salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Olahan%20Afghanistan"&gt;panganan Afghan&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; dumplings kapenuhan &lt;a href="Lokio"&gt;chives&lt;/a&gt;, karo (kerep meaty) &lt;a href="Saus%20tomat"&gt;tomat sauce&lt;/a&gt;, paling ndhuwur karo &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;yogurt&lt;/a&gt; lan pepe &lt;a href="Godhong%20Mint"&gt;Mint&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan sing mbutuhake wektu kanggo nyiyapake, biasane disedhiyakake nalika preinan utawa ing pakumpulan khusus. 
